{"1301930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Traffic Jams", "steam_appid": 1301930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301930/extras/2c83204aefec18a640e4bd250330646a.poster.avif?t=1618241764\" width=680 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301930/extras/2c83204aefec18a640e4bd250330646a.webm?t=1618241764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301930/extras/2c83204aefec18a640e4bd250330646a.mp4?t=1618241764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traffic Jams</h2><br>In this wacky VR game, control traffic your way in the face of outrageous events, flagrant road rage and up to 4 non-VR friends in party mode!<br><br>Starting out on a quiet corner in a small town, job offers start pouring in from around the globe. Guide rude pedestrians, impatient drivers, and the occasional meteorite along before road rage strikes. Sound easy? Think again! This wacky VR game is full of monsters, (un)natural disasters, and something called… ‘cheese bowling’?<br><br>In Traffic Jams, you’ll be taken under the wing of Dennis, the self-proclaimed world’s best traffic controller… EVER! Armed with dreams of superstardom, a sassy attitude and fresh dance moves, he will take you on a jam-packed global adventure on the road to friendship.<br><br>Made it to the top in career mode? Keep your VR headset cool as up to 4 non-VR friends turn up the heat in (couch) party mode!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Career mode: </strong>Control traffic your way - around the globe!<br></li><li><strong>Easy to pick up, hard to master:</strong> Traffic controlling may seem easy; it isn’t!<br></li><li><strong>Wacky challenges: </strong> Each city introduces its own events, ranging from pesky to outrageous<br></li><li><strong>Party mode:</strong> Join up to 4 non-VR friends in party mode!</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301930/extras/2c83204aefec18a640e4bd250330646a.poster.avif?t=1618241764\" width=680 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301930/extras/2c83204aefec18a640e4bd250330646a.webm?t=1618241764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301930/extras/2c83204aefec18a640e4bd250330646a.mp4?t=1618241764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traffic Jams</h2><br>In this wacky VR game, control traffic your way in the face of outrageous events, flagrant road rage and up to 4 non-VR friends in party mode!<br><br>Starting out on a quiet corner in a small town, job offers start pouring in from around the globe. Guide rude pedestrians, impatient drivers, and the occasional meteorite along before road rage strikes. Sound easy? Think again! This wacky VR game is full of monsters, (un)natural disasters, and something called… ‘cheese bowling’?<br><br>In Traffic Jams, you’ll be taken under the wing of Dennis, the self-proclaimed world’s best traffic controller… EVER! Armed with dreams of superstardom, a sassy attitude and fresh dance moves, he will take you on a jam-packed global adventure on the road to friendship.<br><br>Made it to the top in career mode? Keep your VR headset cool as up to 4 non-VR friends turn up the heat in (couch) party mode!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Career mode: </strong>Control traffic your way - around the globe!<br></li><li><strong>Easy to pick up, hard to master:</strong> Traffic controlling may seem easy; it isn’t!<br></li><li><strong>Wacky challenges: </strong> Each city introduces its own events, ranging from pesky to outrageous<br></li><li><strong>Party mode:</strong> Join up to 4 non-VR friends in party mode!</li></ul>", "short_description": "In this wacky VR game, control traffic your way in the face of outrageous events and flagrant road rage. Easy? Think again! Traffic Jams throws in monsters, (un)natural disasters, and up to 4 non-VR friends in party mode!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“On the streets [of Traffic Jams] all hell breaks loose”<br>9.2 – Pixel Magazine<br><br>“Suitable for 100% of gamers”<br>7 – Realovirtual<br><br>“A crazy, chaotic VR traffic control simulator”<br>Beardo Benjo<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301930/header.jpg?t=1618241764", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1618241764", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1301930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1618241764", "website": "http://trafficjams-vr.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 470 or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> vr headset necessary, 2x USB 3.0 ports</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windo